# Build outputs — rewritten by `bun run build`, so formatting them here would only
# be undone the next time the build runs and turn the format gate red.
dist/
assets/ui-template.html

# Test fixtures are inputs: their exact bytes are what the tests assert against,
# so a formatter must not be free to rewrite them.
tests/fixtures/

# Documentation shape is owned by the doc contract tests, not by the formatter.
# `tests/unit/skill-assets/*` asserts exact rows such as "| `lint` | n/a |", and
# prettier re-pads every Markdown table it touches — three of those contracts broke
# the moment it did. The parity checks (skill:check / docs:check / contract:check)
# are the gate for these files; prettier has nothing to add and something to break.
**/*.md
**/*.mdc
docs/**/*.html
.windsurfrules

# Managed copies: `bun run plugin:sync` writes these byte-for-byte from `assets/`.
skills/
plugins/dbcli-agent/skills/
.github/skills/
.cursor/
.windsurf/
